    "message": "Merge PR #273: query issuer action history through the completed session\n\nUse the documented single-issuer thscode + to request for every planned stock, omitting the optional lower bound from the initial request. Validate successful retained history and apply unchanged 5/20-day event-window checks. Keep 3002 unavailable, preserve older events without inventing old calendar qualification, and reject partial/oversized/contradictory histories. No retry, fallback provider, new request budget, gate/ranking change or authority expansion.\n\nAll six file diffs reviewed. Full PR CI 34144980263 / test 101814927437: 1908 passed in 601.72s, exact checkout 09f7d99db647af3e32b84141b723606c2caf916e merging reviewed head 25528b478e333823139bdc59fb3ff70c6605f608 into unchanged main 6fdcf85e7dee404e360491700aea2a5f20b50f5a. Full checkout/install/pytest log read and final workflow success verified. No review submissions, unresolved threads or issue comments. No new live HiThink request, no interpretation of old 3002 as absence and no stock P0 success claim.",
